le Fit.png", "id": "1033211114593372", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86794643_1033211117926705_3117466909561812951_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m2vWLS58Nz4Q7kNvwEgsV43&_nc_oc=AdkSI27ABHNcKRLf7965ODlSIbAJ2F0h-bXIJSEuCmapBlB8Hy7pNh4DQe5DmLKUiOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzmy89AL9OXsLs9gbtegITEW0lnoS0Y43RMmSRl3zKobA&oe=69AAC311"}, {"file_name": "Scales Fit.png", "id": "1274722773218037", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031479_1274722776551370_198509303584703668_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ekx100gE6AYQ7kNvwFuhqMl&_nc_oc=AdmCY-qoRPqlphu2oGPYQMvQDxWK9IDBxSCEBNHxta0LX26rjoYZGpoCnu3PQGMV2t8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxiIEMYsj1rBeNOx7I8JaFSXym4yJicdcgwOEsAF2DebQ&oe=69AADA8F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Store Thumb.png", "id": "1514058476107369", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974584_1514058479440702_2118685885866131343_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l6Lwp_TeMLEQ7kNvwHx04_5&_nc_oc=AdkoA1_3xf3rFufTztAVjIGKJhw5JddQudWi3HvolohEOhbMIWFI2CAe9wa7DSTP_HY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyXuaZq-gU6E2iU0l8oKRtPLgADqHqFe-WBye-mNaeMtg&oe=69AAD5FA"}, "display_name": "Dragon Front Rising", "keywords": ["MixedReality", "Fantasy", "Dragons", "CCG", "Strategy"], "long_description": "Challenge players online or solo with Conquest mode in this immersive collectible card-battler. Dragon Front Rising mixes high fantasy with World War II on a 4x4 grid battlefield that is alive with rampaging giants, intimidating war-machines, and soaring projectiles.\n\n* Meta Quest 3 and Meta Quest Pro users can enjoy Dragon Front Rising in cutting edge Mixed Reality (MR)\n\n* Online Multiplayer \u2013 Challenge your friends, or online armies, and climb through the competitive ranks for rewards.\n\n* 7 Thematically Diverse 